# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository regardless of the
# checkout platform. Prevents Windows editors/tools from turning every
# touched file into a full-file diff purely from CRLF conversion (this
# happened to 32 files in one sitting — see git history around 2026-07-04).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary / generated — never touch line endings.
*.bin binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.db binary
*.sqlite binary
